1
00:00:00,560 --> 00:00:03,490
(Penny:)Shut up!

2
00:00:03,490 --> 00:00:05,890
(Leonard:)Sheldon, are you gonna join us?

3
00:00:05,890 --> 00:00:07,460
(Sheldon:)Coming!

4
00:00:21,840 --> 00:00:24,060
(Sheldon:)Greetings, friends.

5
00:00:24,060 --> 00:00:27,100
(Leonard:)Greetings, whatever
the hell you are.

6
00:00:27,100 --> 00:00:30,540
(Sheldon-bot:)I am a mobile
virtual presence device.

7
00:00:30,540 --> 00:00:32,120
(Sheldon-bot:)Recent events

8
00:00:32,120 --> 00:00:35,560
(Sheldon-bot:)have demonstrated to me
that my body is too fragile

9
00:00:35,560 --> 00:00:38,060
(Sheldon-bot:)to endure the vicissitudes
of the world.

10
00:00:38,060 --> 00:00:40,530
(Sheldon-bot:)Until such time as I am able

11
00:00:40,530 --> 00:00:41,960
(Sheldon-bot:)to transfer my consciousness,

12
00:00:41,960 --> 00:00:44,800
(Sheldon-bot:)I shall remain
in a secure location

13
00:00:44,800 --> 00:00:48,150
(Sheldon-bot:)and interact with the world
in this manner.

14
00:00:48,950 --> 00:00:50,340
(Howard(after Raj whispers to him):)Really? That's
your question--

15
00:00:50,340 --> 00:00:59,020
(Howard(after Raj whispers to him):)when did he
put a ramp in?

